.* RESTORE: the task menu for restoring.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 2'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='RESTORE'.
:IMPORT NAME=QSMNRST PNLGRP=QHWMCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=RST PNLGRP=QHRSCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=RSTCFG PNLGRP=QHSRCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=RSTLIB PNLGRP=QHSRCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=RSTLICPGM PNLGRP=QHSZCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=RSTOBJ PNLGRP=QHSRCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=RSTUSRPRF PNLGRP=QHSRCMD.
:KEYL HELP='KEYS/MENUKEYS' NAME=MENUKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F13 ACTION='MENU INFO'.F13=Information Assistant
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='MENU MAIN'.F16=System Main menu
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=RESTORE HELP=HLPRESTORE KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM PANELID=PANELID.Restore
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUGRP.Restore Data
:MENUI HELP=RSTOBJ OPTION=1 ACTION='CMD ?RSTOBJ OBJTYPE(*FILE)'.Files
:MENUI HELP=RSTLIB OPTION=2 ACTION='CMD ?RSTLIB'.Libraries
:MENUI HELP='RESTORE/OPT3' OPTION=3 ACTION='CMD ?RSTDLO'.Documents and folders
:MENUI HELP=RSTOBJ OPTION=4 ACTION='CMD ?RSTOBJ OBJTYPE(*PGM)'.Programs
:MENUI HELP=RSTOBJ OPTION=5 ACTION='CMD ?RSTOBJ'.Other objects
:MENUI HELP=RSTLICPGM OPTION=6 ACTION='CMD ?RSTLICPGM'.Licensed programs
:MENUI HELP=RSTCFG OPTION=7 ACTION='CMD ?RSTCFG'.Configuration
:MENUI HELP=RSTUSRPRF OPTION=8 ACTION='CMD ?RSTUSRPRF'.User profiles
:MENUI HELP=RST OPTION=9 ACTION='CMD ?RST'.Objects in directories
:EMENUGRP.
:MENUGRP.Restore System and User Data
:MENUI HELP=QSMNRST OPTION=21 ACTION='CMD QSMNRST OPTION(21)'.System and user data
:MENUI HELP=QSMNRST OPTION=22 ACTION='CMD QSMNRST OPTION(22)'.System data only
:MENUI HELP=QSMNRST OPTION=23 ACTION='CMD QSMNRST OPTION(23)'.All user data
:EMENUGRP.
:MENUGRP.Restore Office Data
:MENUI HELP='RESTORE/OPT30' OPTION=30 ACTION='CMD ?RSTDLO DLO(*ALL)'.All documents, folders, and mail
:MENUI HELP='RESTORE/OPT31' OPTION=31 ACTION='CMD ?RSTDLO'.Documents and folders
:MENUI HELP='RESTORE/OPT32' OPTION=32 ACTION='CMD ?RSTDLO DLO(*MAIL)'.Mail only
:EMENUGRP.
:MENUGRP.Restore Libraries
:MENUI HELP=RSTLIB OPTION=40 ACTION='CMD ?RSTLIB SAVLIB(*NONSYS)'.All libraries other than system library
:MENUI HELP=RSTLIB OPTION=41 ACTION='CMD ?RSTLIB SAVLIB(*IBM)'.All IBM libraries other than system library
:MENUI HELP=RSTLIB OPTION=42 ACTION='CMD ?RSTLIB SAVLIB(*ALLUSR)'.All user libraries
:EMENUGRP.
:MENUGRP.Restore from Different Systems
:MENUI HELP='RESTORE/OPT50' OPTION=50 ACTION='MENU RSTS36FMT'.Restore from System/36 format
:EMENUGRP.
:MENUGRP.Related Commands
:MENUI HELP='RESTORE/OPT70' OPTION=70 ACTION='MENU CMDRST'.Related commands
:EMENUGRP.
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPRESTORE.Restore - Help
:P.Bringing saved objects back from media, one kind at a time or the whole
system. Prompted options show what will be restored before it starts.
:P.Type an option number or a command and press Enter. F4 prompts the
command, F9 brings the previous one back, F12 returns to the menu shown
before this one.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F4=Prompt
:PD.Prompts the command on the command line, or the command of the
option typed.
:PT.F9=Retrieve
:PD.Puts the last command run back on the command line; press it again
for the one before.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:PT.F13=Information Assistant
:PD.Shows menu INFO.
:PT.F16=System Main menu
:PD.Shows menu MAIN.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='RESTORE/OPT3'.Documents and folders
:P.Option 3. Runs the RSTDLO command&colon. Documents and folders.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='RESTORE/OPT30'.All documents, folders, and mail
:P.Option 30. Runs RSTDLO DLO(*ALL)&colon. All documents, folders, and
mail.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='RESTORE/OPT31'.Documents and folders
:P.Option 31. Runs the RSTDLO command&colon. Documents and folders.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='RESTORE/OPT32'.Mail only
:P.Option 32. Runs RSTDLO DLO(*MAIL)&colon. Mail only.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='RESTORE/OPT50'.Restore from System/36 format
:P.Option 50. Shows menu RSTS36FMT&colon. Restore from System/36 format.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='RESTORE/OPT70'.Related commands
:P.Option 70. Shows menu CMDRST&colon. Related commands.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
